  "body": "Found in the independent run of PR #3668. PR #3058 (Waterjet Profile) added `assets/ui/op-waterjet-profile.png` and its SVG, but not the copy in `site/static/icons/`. The site test `site/tests/test_guide_icons.py::test_component_static_icons_and_license_match_app` fails on `main`: \"Missing site icon ... site/static/icons/op-waterjet-profile.png\" and \"Stale or missing PNGs in site/static/icons/\". The gate does not run this test (the third test of the file needs `zola`). **Wanted:** make the site icon with the tool that makes the other site icons (do not copy by hand if a tool exists), and run the two icon tests. **Also:** decide if the site icon test that needs no `zola` can run in the gate, so that the next new icon does not make it red.",
